          "message": {
            "text": "The strict headless logical oracle passed 2/2 comprehensive rows with exact-fragment-span-agreement: horizontal Range/CDP/source/paint cardinality 7/6/7/6 and vertical 4/4/4/4. It retained exact source spans plus clusters, gids, advances, offsets and fragment origins, and rejected collapse, reorder and wrong-span mutations; no screenshot or pixel threshold participates.",
            "markdown": "The strict headless logical oracle passed 2/2 comprehensive rows with exact-fragment-span-agreement: horizontal Range/CDP/source/paint cardinality 7/6/7/6 and vertical 4/4/4/4. It retained exact source spans plus clusters, gids, advances, offsets and fragment origins, and rejected collapse, reorder and wrong-span mutations; no screenshot or pixel threshold participates."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
